As an suggestion, shall we add may be in
AddProp l21:
markpure <- grep("PURE", input)

something like
markpure <- grep("PURE|EQUILIBRIUM|EQUILIBRIA|PURE_PHASES|PURE", input) ?

Sorry for the inconvenience.


